{{Elections in Idaho}}

The '''1990 United States Senate election in Idaho''' was held on November 6, 1990. Republican Rep. [[Larry Craig]] defeated Democratic former state legislator [[Ron J. Twilegar|Ron Twilegar]] for the seat of U.S. Senator [[James A. McClure|Jim McClure]], who did not seek reelection.

== Major Candidates ==
=== Republican ===
* [[Larry Craig]], U.S. Representative
* [[Jim Jones (jurist)|Jim Jones]], [[Idaho Attorney General]]

=== Democratic ===
* [[Ron J. Twilegar|Ron Twilegar]], former State Senator
* David C. Steed

